			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.0.1 — Initial Release\n\n- Added the dwarf planet **Eris** as a landable dimension\n- Custom sky rendering: black sky, visible stars, dimmed distant Sun\n- Low-gravity physics (~0.084g) with scaled fall damage\n- Eris ore, stone and sand variants\n- Curated worldgen: AE2 meteorites enabled, other structures disabled\n- Telescope integration, including a fix for Pluto's display position\n- Initial data-driven planet framework"
